      "message": "We have to stick with foreground/background pairs when using HCM colors -- we can't put Canvas or Button colors on top of a Selecteditem colored background :( \nWe could either:\n* Use SelectedItemText for all the labels here, and keep the radio buttons as they are, accepting they may not render perfectly or\n* Use Canvas for the background and SelectedItem for the border (instead of CanvasText). The selection will be less obvious, but we'll guarantee readability. \nI'm leaning towards the latter -- can you mock this up? Also, what's this kind of control called? (the radio item with more radio items in it)\n\n@Anna Yeddi interested in your thoughts here.",
