      "message": "I'm not sure we can support this bulleted list within a group of radio buttons for screen reader users. \nA radio group is required to identify these buttons (Default, Only use HTTPS, Try HTTPS first, Custom) as related. A radio group expects only radio button children, but if we want to expose the description of each option after the option itself, we have to violate the \"only radio button children\" rule. @Anna Yeddi do you have ideas for a workaroudn here? \nI also anticipate the \"View and customize\" button in the \"Custom\" radio button label will be a problem",
